    skos:prefLabel "61 Section 40-1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-61 ;
    values:originalText "Omit: A number of approvals and other decisions may need to have been made under Chapter 2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 before a particular kind of payment can be made (see section 5-2 of that Act). Receipt of payments under this Chapter gives rise to certain responsibilities, that are dealt with in Chapter 4 of this Act and Chapter 4 of the Aged Care Act 1997. substitute: A number of approvals and other decisions may need to have been made under Chapter 2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 before a  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Omit: A number of approvals and other decisions may need to have been made under Chapter 2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 before a particular kind of payment can be made (see section 5-2 of that Act). Receipt of payments under this Chapter gives rise to certain responsibilities, that are dealt with in Chapter 4 of this Act and Chapter 4 of the Aged Care Act 1997. substitute: A number of approvals and other decisions may need to have been made under Chapter 2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 before a  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
