    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-65 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: Employees etc. of Agencies and Commonwealth authorities  (1) The Secretary may, in writing, delegate all or any of the powers and functions of the Secretary under this Act, the regulations or any Principles made under section 96-1 to a person engaged (whether as an employee or otherwise) by:  (a) an Agency (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999); or  (b) an authority of the Commonwealth." ;
