concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-72 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72 Obligation to notify Secretary about home care services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-72 ;
    values:originalText "etc. (1) This item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an allocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of a particular home care service is in effect. (2) The approved provider is taken, on the commencement of this item, to have notified the Secretary in relation to the service in accordance with subsections 9-1A(1) to (3) of the new law." ;
    skos:definition "etc. (1) This item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an allocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of a particular home care service is in effect. (2) The approved provider is taken, on the commencement of this item, to have notified the Secretary in relation to the service in accordance with subsections 9-1A(1) to (3) of the new law."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e37bad16c2ac6adbef401c5730b215da30195b43470cfd6754f7a4b2298d407a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notify Secretary about home care services" ;
    dc:description "Notification of service commencement" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf> ;
