concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Responsibilities of approved providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "To avoid doubt, paragraph 63-1(1)(e) of the old law continues to apply in relation to a place allocated in respect of home care subsidy that is transferred before the commencement time." ;
